# Google indexing for SwishIt

- Do **not** tell the user to use Search Console “Request indexing” — it does not work for this project.
- Prefer the existing **sitemap** (`https://swishit.onrender.com/sitemap.xml`, generated by `src/app/sitemap.ts`) for discovery and crawl reminders.
- Do not change `robots.txt` or the sitemap unless there is a real technical problem.
- Favicon / logo updates in Google Search results can take days to weeks after deploy; autocomplete may update sooner than SERP icons.
